cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Allwinner D1 OS Benchmark and RunTime Panel"
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
type: software
abstract: >
  Bring-up and benchmarking of Linux, RT-Thread RT-Smart and Apache NuttX
  on the same Allwinner D1 / XuanTie C906 RISC-V platform, including
  watchdog and timer diagnosis, cross-OS latency measurements, and a
  native 720x720 RunTime touchscreen interface with display, touch and
  Wi-Fi support.
message: "If you use this software or the accompanying benchmark results, please cite this work."
authors:
